                {
                  "text": "Américo Paredes Interviews, 1994",
                  "textSize": "heading-three"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "This series of interviews was collected in 1994 in Américo Paredes's home in Austin, TX. He is interviewed by Manuel F. Medrano. Appearances are also made by "
                },
                {
                  "text": "Antonio Zavaleta",
                  "link": "https://drtonyzavaleta.com/"
                },
                {
                  "text": ", Amelia Sidzu Nagamine Paredes, and Paredes's nephew. Between each video there is some disruption in the flow of the interview, sometimes cutting off mid-sentence. In part 5 of this series the interview ends and shifts into an informal book-signing session in Dr. Paredes's study."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
